{"id": "69218", "title": "医本正经？", "author": "江湖郎中", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69218.htm", "intro": "意外怀孕肿么办？？？？？？\r\nA 自己去屎。\r\nB 让那个混蛋男人去屎。\r\nC 结婚，要屎一起屎。\r\n于是，宋茉茉选了C。\r\n\r\n这是一个泌尿科炸毛女医师同海龟闷骚男医师419之后的故事，\r\n\r\n正所谓有缘千里419，不是闷骚不碰头。\r\n\r\n隐婚是被逼的，结局是待定的，约定是一辈子的......\r\n\r\n（至于你们信不信，反正我是信了。）", "base": "files/article/html/69/69218", "chapters": [{"title": "01 茉茉不正经？", "file": "10587823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02 临安不正经？ 03 茉茉很正经！", "file": "10587824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04 临安很正经！", "file": "10587825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05 茉茉不正经？", "file": "10587826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06 临安不正经？", "file": "10587827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "07 茉茉很正经！", "file": "10587828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "08 临安很正经！", "file": "10587829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "09 茉茉不正经？", "file": "10587830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10 临安不正经？", "file": "10587831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11 茉茉很正经！（小修）", "file": "10587832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12 临安很正经！", "file": "10587833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13 茉茉不正经？", "file": "10587834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14 临安不正经？", "file": "10587835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15 茉茉很正经！", "file": "10587836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16 临临很正经！", "file": "10587837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17 茉茉不正经？", "file": "10587838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18 临安不正经？", "file": "10587839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19 茉茉很正经！", "file": "10587840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20 临安很正经！", "file": "10587841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21 茉茉不正经？ 22 临安不正经？", "file": "10587842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-28", "file": "10587843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-35", "file": "10587844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-41", "file": "1058